{
  "source": "Prompts/work-with-ai-opener-v17.mp4",
  "duration": 104.2773125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.74,
      "text": "You've seen the tool, you know what the interface looks like, and you've watched"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.74,
      "end": 5.78,
      "text": "it perform a few impressive tasks."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.54,
      "end": 7.56,
      "text": "Now it gets practical."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.14,
      "end": 9.68,
      "text": "How do you actually work with that?"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.62,
      "end": 14.06,
      "text": "There is a detail about this technology that often goes unnoticed."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.86,
      "end": 18.1,
      "text": "People tend to assume the software guarantees the outcome on its own."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.86,
      "end": 20.82,
      "text": "This graphic spells out a common reality."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.48,
      "end": 23.22,
      "text": "Same tool, different results."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.08,
      "end": 27.62,
      "text": "Two people can use the same AI system and get completely different outputs."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.220000000000002,
      "end": 29.9,
      "text": "Think of it like taking a photograph."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.78,
      "end": 32.14,
      "text": "Imagine we have two different people."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.9,
      "end": 35.2,
      "text": "Both of them are holding the exact same smartphone."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.92,
      "end": 38.72,
      "text": "And they are both trying to take a picture of the exact same subject."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.24,
      "end": 40.12,
      "text": "Let's say a sandwich."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.0,
      "end": 44.76,
      "text": "One person pulls out their phone, taps the screen without preparing a clear goal,"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.9,
      "end": 46.1,
      "text": "and quickly snaps the shot."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.56,
      "end": 50.14,
      "text": "The result is a rushed, blurry picture of lunch that you can't really use for"
    },
    {
      "start": 50.14,
      "end": 50.42,
      "text": "anything."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.22,
      "end": 53.16,
      "text": "The other person takes a few extra seconds."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.66,
      "end": 56.76,
      "text": "They check the lighting, frame the subject with intent, and"
    },
    {
      "start": 56.76,
      "end": 58.64,
      "text": "steady their hands before pressing the button."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.2,
      "end": 61.54,
      "text": "They end up with a crisp, professional-looking image."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.16,
      "end": 64.2,
      "text": "The hardware in their hands was identical."
    },
    {
      "start": 64.84,
      "end": 67.72,
      "text": "To get a crisp, highly useful response from the system,"
    },
    {
      "start": 68.26,
      "end": 71.22,
      "text": "your first step is to provide a clear, specific goal."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.98,
      "end": 76.08,
      "text": "Then, once it generates a response, you have to manually read through it,"
    },
    {
      "start": 76.36,
      "end": 79.62,
      "text": "verify the facts, and check the work before you actually apply it."
    },
    {
      "start": 80.16,
      "end": 82.92,
      "text": "This section will help you answer three specific questions."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.47999999999999,
      "end": 86.72,
      "text": "First, where could AI help the most in my work?"
    },
    {
      "start": 87.42,
      "end": 89.24,
      "text": "How do I get great answers from AI?"
    },
    {
      "start": 90.24,
      "end": 93.08,
      "text": "Finally, what can I do to make those answers even better?"
    },
    {
      "start": 93.86,
      "end": 96.68,
      "text": "Don't just use AI, work with it."
    },
    {
      "start": 97.04,
      "end": 100.08,
      "text": "It doesn't replace your thinking, it multiplies it."
    }
  ],
